    "documentation_notes": "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Load Diffusion Model\n### Download **flux-2-klein-4b-fp8 (distilled)** ~3.8GB from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/flux2` \n\nCreate the `flux2` folder if it does not exist)\n \n---\n\n## 🟣 Load CLIP\n\n###  Download **qwen_3_4b.safetensors** ~7.8GB from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`  \n\n--- \n\n## 🟣 Load VAE\n\n### Download the **flux2-vae** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/vae`  \n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n-\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n\nKeep the dog the same, add a collar on its neck with a round metal tag, put the logo from the second image engraved on the tag, keep the logo shape unchanged, realistic metal shine and shadows."
